# Compiled Nim test executables (the `.nim` sources are tracked; the binaries
# `nim c -r` drops next to them are build artifacts).
#
# Matched by pattern rather than listed one-by-one: the per-file list went
# stale as soon as tests were added, leaving six untracked binaries in a
# tree that the workspace pre-push hook requires to be clean.
tests/test_*
!tests/test_*.nim

